OL,3,ATwo streets to be demolished in mining
OL,4,Asubsidence village Coalsnaughton
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of two streets in a
OL,7,FClackmannanshire village facing mining
OL,8,Fsubsidence have been told their homes
OL,9,Fwill have to be demolished.
OL,11,FMeetings were held with residents of
OL,12,FCoalsnaughton on Thursday evening where
OL,13,F97 properties have been evacuated due
OL,14,Fto ground movement.
OL,16,FOfficials from the local council and
OL,17,Fthe Mining Remediation Authority (MRA)
OL,18,Ftold them that 60 houses on two
OL,19,Fstreets, Benbuck View and Dunmoss View,
OL,20,Fwould have to be knocked down.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
