OL,3,ATwo streets to be demolished in mining
OL,4,Asubsidence village Coalsnaughton
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe MRA said remediation work will be
OL,7,Fcarried out on two other affected
OL,8,Fstreets, Nechtan Drive and Langour, to
OL,9,Fmake them safe.
